</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학생명의</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.8pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">제출 장소 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">푸름관 관리동 행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">5. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">기타</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">공공기관 발급 서류에 한 함 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">주민등록등본 및 가족관계증명서로 한부 모가족 신청 불가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">건강보험료로 가계곤란 증명 불가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">국민건강보험공 단이 발급하는 차상위본인부담경감대상자 증명서로 차상위계층 신청 불가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">배정인원 보다 신청자가 많을 경우 반영 점수</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">직전학기 성적 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">+ </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">원거리 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">점수</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">순으로 선발</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">금액적 혜택은 없으며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">우선선발 기회 부여</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;라</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">서류 심사후 합격자는 생활관 홈페이지에 공지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-as